title: Source control opens where the files are, follows the folder chosen in the workspace, and the files come back by their icon
folders: git-changes, rust-small
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3500
left changes
wait 900
mark a-source-control-docked
wait 400
tab 2
wait 1500
mark b-other-repository
wait 400
tab 1
wait 1200
left files
wait 900
mark c-files-again
wait 400
quit
